# Demonic Counsel with three card types in the graveyard (artifact Black Lotus and Memnite, instant Entomb, creature Grizzly
# Bears: delirium is off): search for a Demon card, reveal it, put it into the hand, then shuffle. Hill Giant isn't a Demon,
# and Bot2's Demonic Hordes in their own library can't be found.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Entomb
Entomb
Demonic Counsel
Swamp
Swamp
Grizzly Bears
Memnite
Demonic Hordes
Hill Giant
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Demonic Hordes
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Entomb#1.Cast
Bot1.Search(Grizzly Bears)
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Memnite)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Demonic Counsel.Cast
? Bot1.Graveyard = Entomb; Memnite; Entomb; Grizzly Bears; Black Lotus
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Search(Hill Giant)
Bot1.Search(Demonic Hordes)

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Demonic Hordes.Power = 5
Bot1.Revealed = Demonic Hordes
Bot1.Shuffles = 3
Bot2.Library.Demonic Hordes.Power = 5
Bot2.Shuffles = 0
